<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Standard Equities suspends employee.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Standard Equities suspends employee.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroking firm Standard Equities said on Wednesday it had suspended an employee for alleged breaches of Johannesburg Stock Exchange regulations.</p>
<p>It said that while a probe into the employee's activities were not complete, amounts identified so far were not substantial and no clients would sustain any losses.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
